1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,680
Snap your fingers...

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,591
Cute.

3
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:03,850
This shrimp's snap

4
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:05,500
gets nearly as hot...

5
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,700
as the Sun.

6
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,550
That bang isn't the claw.

7
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,988
It's a BUBBLE.

8
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:12,109
The claw slams so fast,

9
00:00:12,109 --> 00:00:13,800
it rips the water open...

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,880
then the bubble crushes itself.

11
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:16,690
Bang!

12
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:19,933
Nearly five thousand degrees.

13
00:00:19,967 --> 00:00:21,440
It even flashes.

14
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,959
Scientists named it...

15
00:00:22,959 --> 00:00:25,033
shrimpoluminescence.

16
00:00:25,061 --> 00:00:26,510
In World War Two,

17
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:27,961
their crackle scrambled

18
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:29,633
the Navy's sonar.

19
00:00:29,668 --> 00:00:30,635
So...

20
00:00:30,635 --> 00:00:32,061
never challenge a shrimp

21
00:00:32,061 --> 00:00:33,800
to a snap-off.

